# Git workflow

- Feature work happens on `feat/<topic>` branches (POS + Books slimming lives on `feat/pos-books-web`). `main` deploys production and `staging` deploys staging through `.github/workflows`.
- Only commit or push when the user asks. Push the current branch with `git push origin HEAD`; never force-push `main` or `staging`.
- Before committing: `npm run typecheck` and `npm run lint` on the files you changed.
- Never commit `.env*` files except `.env.example`.
